--
-- Flips status 'pending' -> 'active' so they render on /profile/[slug].
-- Run this in phpMyAdmin -> SQL AFTER you've loaded seed-pro-services-200.sql.
-- Then REDEPLOY (profiles are SSG, built at deploy time).
